		(property "Notes" "CHG_INH from the MCU (DIO24): low allows charging; high or hi-Z (reset, WDT reset, ROM bootloader, unprogrammed) stops it at the CE pin via the R417/R517 pull-up, independent of the TPS25751. Keep DIS_CE_PIN = 0"
